Note on scope: this license covers the code in this repository. It does not
cover the model weights or the datasets. The base model
(Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct) is Apache-2.0 and the LoRA adapter inherits that;
NoteChat and PMC-Patients are public research datasets under their own
terms. See docs/MODEL_CARD.md, which also states that the adapter must not
be used in any clinical or patient-facing setting.
